        ["Why's that?"] = "¿Por qué?",
        ["Well.. what with all these warriors around, there's not much chance of my bank being robbed is there!"] = "Bueno... ¡con todos estos guerreros alrededor, no hay muchas posibilidades de que roben mi banco!",
