        ["The 'Little Boss' is a bit strict with us, but don't get me wrong, we're all glad that The Skulls aren't causing trouble in Draynor anymore."] = "El 'Pequeño Jefe' es un poco estricto con nosotros, pero no me malinterpretes, todos estamos contentos de que Los Calaveras ya no estén causando problemas en Draynor.",
